OL,3,GNEWSA'My mother died alone because the
OL,4,Acar park was full'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I missed the death of my mother, who
OL,7,Fdied alone, because the car park was
OL,8,Ffull."
OL,10,FAndrea Wright says she wasn't able to
OL,11,Fbe with her mother when she died
OL,12,Fseveral years ago because she was
OL,13,Flooking for a car parking space at the
OL,14,FJohn Radcliffe Hospital in Oxford.
OL,16,FShe is now one of more than 700 people
OL,17,Fwho have shared their similar
OL,18,Fexperiences in support of a petition to
OL,19,Freform the hospital's parking
OL,20,Farrangements.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
