OL,3,GNEWSA'My mother died alone because the
OL,4,Acar park was full'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has already received about 1,500
OL,7,Fsignatures and was started by
OL,8,Findependent city and county councillor
OL,9,FDavid Henwood, who said it was "about
OL,10,Fmaking sure people can reach the care
OL,11,Fthey need without extra stress".
